  "body": "Presenting The Clarence - a boutique collection of 14 luxury residences in Long Bay, offering two and three-bedroom homes alongside an exclusive four-bedroom penthouse.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by Templeton and designed by Ignite Architects, each residence has been carefully considered to deliver sophisticated coastal living with exceptional attention to detail.\r\n\r\nThe three-bedroom residences are priced from $3,500,000 and range from 188sqm to 194sqm, with expansive living spaces unfolding towards generous balconies of up to 26sqm, where natural light, considered design and uninterrupted outlooks create an atmosphere of quiet sophistication. Each residence features three spacious bedrooms with ensuite facilities, complemented by a dedicated study, additional powder room, generous open-plan kitchen, living and dining areas, and two carparks.\r\n\r\nInteriors by Macintosh Harris are defined by bespoke detailing and a sophisticated material palette, with two curated interior schemes offering a choice of natural textures, warm tones and stone finishes. Beautifully appointed kitchens feature stone benchtops, bespoke cabinetry, premium Fisher & Paykel appliances and feature lighting, while luxurious tiled bathrooms incorporate underfloor heating and carefully selected finishes throughout.\r\n\r\nBeyond the residences, an extensive suite of wellness and lifestyle amenities enhances everyday living, including a dedicated gym and yoga studio, a spa with jacuzzi, sauna, steam room and plunge pool, alongside thoughtful conveniences such as secure bike storage and a dedicated dog wash.\r\n\r\nSecure basement carparking is provided, with a minimum of two carparks allocated to every residence. Carpark stackers are available to select apartments, with additional storage locker options also available.\r\n\r\nPositioned moments from Long Bay Beach, the Regional Park and village, The Clarence places the best of coastal living and everyday convenience within easy reach.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings are available by appointment. Visit theclarencelongbay.co.nz or contact our sales team for further information and current availability.",
